OL,3,GNEWSAUnionists ask NI secretary to pull
OL,4,AStormont Brake
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnionist parties in the Northern
OL,7,FIreland Assembly have formally asked
OL,8,Fthe government to pull the Stormont
OL,9,FBrake in a bid to stop changes to
OL,10,FEuropean Union customs rules.
OL,12,FThe post-Brexit mechanism was designed
OL,13,Fto give Stormont the power to object to
OL,14,Famendments to EU rules that apply in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,17,FIt is the second time politicians have
OL,18,Fsought to deploy the brake, which
OL,19,Frequires the support of 30 members of
OL,20,Fthe legislative assembly (MLAs) from at
OL,21,Fleast two parties.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
